@startuml
actor Admin
participant DashboardController
participant AdminDashboardController
participant SessionFacade
participant UserManager
participant UserDAO

Admin->Navbar: Click "Admin"
Navbar->AdminDashboardController: Open View
AdminDashboardController->SessionFacade: getAllUsers()
SessionFacade->UserManager: getAllUsers()
UserManager->UserDAO: getAllUsers()
UserDAO-->>AdminDashboardController: List of Users
AdminDashboardController->AdminDashboardController: Display Table

Admin->AdminDashboardController: Edit Role (User -> Admin)
AdminDashboardController->SessionFacade: updateUser(userWithNewRole)
SessionFacade->UserManager: updateUser(user)
UserManager->UserDAO: updateUser(user)
UserDAO-->>AdminDashboardController: Success
AdminDashboardController-->>Admin: "Role Updated"
@enduml
